  "description": "Kim Ju-ah just wanted to get to work on time, but one wrong turn onto her favorite baseball team's bus leaves her trapped. The \"Home Team\" is muscular, hungry, and has zero boundaries. Before Ju-ah can even apologize, she’s pinned down by the very athletes she cheers for, forced to listen to their filthy promises to ruin her for any other man. In the back of the bus, Ju-ah is about to find out exactly how much \"stamina\" professional ballplayers really have.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
